    "text": "The refactoring has been implemented. Here's a summary of the design and the complete code.\n\n## Design Overview\n\n**Package layout** (`bench/` package plus two standalone tools):\n\n```\nbench/\n  __init__.py\n  config.py        # strict config loading + validation\n  process.py       # ProcessSupervisor: spawn, watchdog, cancel, guaranteed reaping\n  artifacts.py     # ArtifactWriter: atomic JSON/log writes, manifest building\n  analysis.py      # deterministic analysis of collected rounds/arrivals\n  runner.py        # DFlashBenchmark: the refactored matrix benchmark\n  __main__.py      # CLI entry point\ntools/\n  analyze_window_union.py   # unchanged semantics, refactored internals\n  check_verify_scratch.py   # refactored to use shared supervisor/config\ntests/\n  test_bench.py             # supervisor, config, artifacts, analysis, runner\n  test_analyze_window_union.py  # preserved oracle tests\n```\n\n**Key decisions:**\n\n1. **`ProcessSupervisor`** \u2014 the single owner of child process lifecycle. It spawns children with pipes, arms a watchdog timer, and guarantees in a `finally` block that no child survives: kill \u2192 wait \u2192 reap. Auxiliary",
